<title>USA: Dade gets approval for strep testing procedure.</title>
<headline>Dade gets approval for strep testing procedure.</headline>
<dateline>WEST SACRAMENTO, Calif. 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dade MicroScan Inc said on Thursday that it has received U.S. Food and Drug Administration clearance for the Dade MICroSTREP Panel, a procedure to test for three strains of streptococcus infections.</p>
<p>The procedure tests for antimicrobial susceptibility of three different classes of streptococcus including Streptococcus pneumoniae, viridans streptococci and beta-hemolytic streptococci.</p>
